Sorted:

Arrivals   = [900, 940, 950, 1100, 1500, 1800]
Departures = [910, 1120, 1130, 1200, 1900, 2000]


900 ≤ 910 → platforms = 1

940 ≤ 910 ❌ → free → platforms = 1

950 ≤ 1120 → platforms = 2

1100 ≤ 1120 → platforms = 3 ✔

Max = 3

